OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry opens into
OL,4,AClerkenwell stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has begun after
OL,7,Fa 28-year-old man was fatally stabbed
OL,8,Fin east London.
OL,10,FThe Met Police and the London Ambulance
OL,11,FService were called to Lloyd Baker
OL,12,FStreet, Clerkenwell at about 23:20 BST
OL,13,Fon Wednesday following reports of a
OL,14,Fknife attack.
OL,16,FThe victim was found with stab wounds
OL,17,Fand taken to hospital, but he died from
OL,18,Fhis injuries the next day. His family
OL,19,Fhas been informed and are being
OL,20,Fsupported, the Met said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
